{"title":"Career roadmap · Content Writer","role":"Content Writer","summary":"A Content Writer creates clear, useful and engaging written content for websites, blogs, brands, publications, educational platforms and digital products. English Literature provides a strong foundation in language, interpretation, storytelling, research and written communication.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"English Literature"},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Strong direct alignment. The degree develops language and literary skills, while internships and a portfolio are the key requirements for professional content-writing roles."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Typical route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BA English Literature","Writing/Editorial Internship","Content Writing Intern","Junior Content Writer","Content Writer","Senior Content Writer","Content Strategist / Editor","Content Lead / Editorial Manager","Head of Content"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build writing fundamentals, digital-content skills, SEO knowledge and a strong published portfolio."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in SEO, technical writing, B2B, copywriting, editorial or a high-value industry domain."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Move toward Content Strategist, Managing Editor, Content Lead, Brand Content or Editorial leadership."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead content organisations, build an independent publishing/consulting practice, or specialise as a senior editorial/content strategist."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Grammar, vocabulary, close reading, writing discipline